name eukdate
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc UK format dates, with weekday
relocated 1
longdesc The package is used to change the format of \today's date,
longdesc including the weekday, e.g., "Saturday, 26 June 2008", the 'UK
longdesc format', which is preferred in many parts of the world, as
longdesc distinct from that which is used in \maketitle of the article
longdesc class, "June 26, 2008", the 'US format'.
runfiles size=1
